WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:47.040
I've gone everywhere I can. All that's left is to go abroad. Only if there weren't any oceans...

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:53.300
Bye, everyone! See you next time!

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.380
See you.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.220
Cream, Cheese, I brought a pie fresh out of the oven.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.930
Eat up.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.140
It looks delicious.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:10.190
We are broadcasting live from the President's office today for a special report.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:15.440
The President's aide has just started the press conference.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:20.660
Our nation will not give in to Dr. Eggman!

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:22.990
What?

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:29.270
Episode 12

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:29.270
Before the Attack on Eggman's Base

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:37.340
Sir, do you have strategies to thwart Dr. Eggman?

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:38.470
Yes.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:44.470
The only thing they have is guts. They're not capable of doing anything.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.500
Where's the Chaos Emerald?

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.680
Amy, that's my house.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.680
Where?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.640
The one with the red roof.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.020
Yeah, I see it.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.820
If you want, you should come and visit next time.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.900
Sure, I'd love to visit.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:42.030
Hey Chris. Can you go towards the school?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.660
She says to go to the school.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:53.120
This is not a sightseeing tour. Our goal is to find the third Chaos Emerald.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.540
I know already.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:56.880
Then fine.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.840
By the way, where did you get those goggles? Are they Chuck's newest invention?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:05.010
No, I got them from Mr. Stewart. Do they look good on me?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.010
Yeah, really good.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:10.180
That's good because I like them too.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:25.820
That's the school that Chris and I attend.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.840
The power station in Eggman's base is located here.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:51.060
We learned this from Rouge and Topaz's investigation.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.900
This is a great accomplishment. Just as I expected from you, Rouge.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.770
It wasn't difficult at all.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.610
You're very reliable. I want to hear the plans in detail.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:05.740
Yes, sir.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.410
So you're the only one who gets the credit?

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.160
It was difficult work.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:18.420
Our troops will attack from the air and the sea.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:23.010
But won't Eggman's robots counterattack?

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:31.100
This strategy is a diversion. While Dr. Eggman is distracted by our frontal assault on the island...

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:36.350
Marine special forces will sneak into the base from behind.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.850
They will destroy the power station.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:43.900
Other than members of the Intelligence Agency and Rouge, several others will also take part in this strategy.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.030
I see.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.610
Are we the 'others?'

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:52.330
It can't be helped. We don't make as much of an impact as Rouge.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.410
By the way, in regards to Sonic...

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.580
I'm sorry about that.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.670
No, it's okay. It's fine.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:06.090
The truth is I decided to send a special envoy.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.170
An envoy?

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:15.470
Hello. May I ask who you are?

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.850
Oh my.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.110
Aren't you the President's aide?

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.520
Is Sonic here?

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.280
Who are you talking about? Sonic?

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:32.830
Tell Sonic that I didn't come to arrest him.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.910
I came as an envoy to the President to ask for his cooperation.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.540
Of course, we're not asking him to cooperate for free.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:47.550
If our strategy succeeds, we will welcome him and his friends as honored citizens and guarantee their livelihood.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.220
No matter what you say, I don't know what I don't know.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.800
There's no point playing dumb with me...

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:55.560
...Ella.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:58.230
How do you know my name?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:01.060
You saw the talking female rabbit also, didn't you?

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:05.940
You're very persistent. I said I don't know anything.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:10.700
Don't play dumb with me! Hurry up and bring him here! Or else...

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.040
You...

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:28.760
You guys are Secret Service! Why didn't you protect me?

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:29.920
Did something happen?

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.130
I don't care if he's the President's aide!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:36.850
Acting all arrogant! Doesn't he know we've invited kings from foreign nations before?

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:46.820
I see. I understand. Thanks.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.490
He didn't even get to see him.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:53.160
He's one hell of a stubborn hedgehog.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:01.370
We have no choice. We'll do it ourselves.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.040
There's no other way.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.540
You don't have to worry.

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:11.670
As long as I'm on your side.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.800
Ms. Rouge!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:21.980
I have to get the Chaos Emerald that I failed to acquire the other day.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.620
Where are they flying to?

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.170
I've detected a Chaos Emerald.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.380
Which way?

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.880
South-southeast.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.800
South-southeast.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.720
Everyone, we're going to turn.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.140
Okay.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.110
They've changed direction.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:30.710
So the Chaos Emerald is somewhere in this corn field.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.880
Let's hurry up and climb down, Tails.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.380
There's no need to do that.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.720
Just wait and see.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.770
What?

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.280
Wow!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.580
What's with this thing, Tails?

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:06.410
This is the X-Cyclone, an all-purpose robot that walks upright.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.210
Everyone, we're going to search for the Chaos Emerald in this.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.000
Okay!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.210
This way!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.220
The Chaos Emerald...

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:32.110
This is Teacher calling base. Please respond.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.750
The Chaos Emerald is underneath here?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:55.550
Yeah.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.010
But how are we going to dig it out?

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:01.220
We'll dig it out with X-Cyclone, of course.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:02.640
Right, Tails?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.220
Oh yeah. After all, it's an all-purpose robot.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.850
It doesn't have that feature.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.060
Then it's not an all-purpose robot.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.860
I guess not.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:18.690
I'll go borrow a shovel to dig with.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.450
Me too.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:35.460
Mr. President, we can't let this chance pass. Dr. Eggman is itching to get hold of the Chaos Emerald.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.500
He will definitely leave his base!

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.720
Mr. President, please make a decision!

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:43.640
Mr. President!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.600
All right.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.190
Launch the operation!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.400
Prepare for takeoff.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.490
What's happening?

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.720
All you need to do is spray the stubborn stains.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:25.930
It contains no harmful substances, so it's gentle on your skin.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.430
See?

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.270
That is incredible!

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.810
Wow!

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.770
Is that thing worth being amazed about?

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.980
Everyone, don't miss this opportunity-

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:44.700
What? They found a Chaos Emerald in a corn field at Tingaling Villa?

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.990
A Chaos Emerald? What?

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:51.450
Yes, they say a fox cub is digging it out right now.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.580
Hey, we're in the middle of a TV show!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.830
For stubborn grease stains in the kitchen-

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:01.460
Bring the cards!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.720
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.470
Hmm...

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.520
Which card shall I pick today?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.310
Alright.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.690
Here it goes.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.650
This one!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:53.060
Dr. Eggman and one robot have taken off.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:14:00.980
First squadron, go! The target is Eggman's base in the Southern Sea.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.030
Eggman's base?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.170
Just a little more to go.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.630
Yeah, let's keep at it.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.260
What?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.470
What is it?

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.890
What's that?

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.440
It's Eggman's robot!

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:39.520
Tails!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.490
Is this the location of the Chaos Emerald?

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.990
We won't let you have it!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.030
That's right!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.330
You want to fight even though Sonic isn't with you?

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.000
I'll contact Sonic!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.500
We're counting on you.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:14:59.960
Let's go, Francis.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:00.710
Okay.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:05.170
Go, E-35!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.880
We won't lose!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.510
Here I go!

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.570
Amy!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:33.820
Well done, E-35! Keep at it!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.210
Oh no!

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.920
Look out!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:04.480
What do you think of E-35's power?

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.190
The control stick won't move!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:27.290
I hope Chris and Francis don't do anything rash.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:37.350
Where is it? Where?

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.430
What's going on?

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.310
Damn!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.640
What's happening?

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:24.230
It's an all-out attack by the enemy! Look. They're shooting a lot at us.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.730
Fine! We'll counterattack!

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.760
They're really going at it.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.640
It's time for us to go.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:05.390
Okay.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.950
Today's forecast is clear skiles, today's forecast is clear skiles.

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:26.000
My fellow citizens, my fellow citizens, our military forces today-

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.540
Mr. President, we will start the actual telecast.

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:38.880
We will now bring you a live emergency broadcast from the President's office.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:45.560
My fellow citizens, our military forces today launched an all-out attack against Dr. Eggman.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:51.900
Dr. Eggman has threatened the peace of our country numerous times.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:54.520
I have to tell Sonic!

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:11.290
Dr. Eggman intends to conquer the world. We cannot allow him to this!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.010
Second squadron, go!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.100
Tails!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:15.060
Tails, we're going too!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.020
X-Tornado is gone.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:29.410
Hi Sonic. Tails left this morning with Chris, Amy and Chris' friend Francis. They haven't returned yet.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.540
Where are they at a time like this?

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.800
Why would this be here?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.880
I'll backtrack.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.560
I can't move!

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:02.940
Amy!

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:04.650
Are you both all right?

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:05.700
Yes!

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.660
Damn!

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.460
I'm not going to lose, Eggman!

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:23.970
You're no match for E-35!

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:25.380
What?

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:32.350
And I'm only getting started. If E-35 gets serious, you'll be finished in a snap.

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:42.320
I wonder how long you can hold out?

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:05.630
What is this?

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:10.720
What's going on?

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:19.440
Is this the Thorndyke residence?

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:22.270
Yes, that's right. Yes, yes...

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:23.400
What?

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:28.950
Tingaling Villa? I understand. Thank you very much.

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:31.570
Who was it?

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:33.580
I don't know.

00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:36.660
Sonic, go to Tingaling Villa!

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:38.210
Right!

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:48.840
<b>Tabidatsu junbi wa dekita kai?</b>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:48.840
<i>Are you ready to go on a journey?</i>

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:52.100
<b>mata hitotsu asa ga kuru</b>

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:52.100
<i>Another morning has arrived</i>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.600
<b>Atarashii shatsu ni kigaete</b>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.600
<i>Change into a new shirt</i>

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:59.080
<b>Kurayami wo nukedasou</b>

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:59.080
<i>And escape the darkness</i>

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:02.590
<b>Nemuranai machi wa kyou mo</b>

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:06.690
<i>The sleepless city quietly watches over you again today</i>

00:23:02.590 --> 00:23:06.690
<b>Shizuka ni tada mimamotteiru</b>

00:23:09.470 --> 00:23:12.720
<b>Kimi to boku ga hajimatteyuku!</b>

00:23:09.470 --> 00:23:12.720
<i>We begin to go!</i>

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:16.330
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.100
<b>Tomadowanai de</b>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.100
<i>Don't be bewildered</i>

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:25.960
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:25.960
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:31.010
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:31.010
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.140
<b>Kimi to boku no sekai wo terasou</b>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.140
<i>Shine a light on our world</i>

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:40.640
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:44.150
<b>Kowagaranai de</b>

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:44.150
<i>Don't be scared</i>

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:50.320
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:50.320
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.740
<b>Haruka tooi michi no mukou gawa e</b>

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.740
<i>At the other end of the very long road</i>

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:58.200
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:58.200
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:02.330
<b>Kimi to boku no mirai mitsukeyou ze</b>

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:02.330
<i>Let's find our future</i>

00:24:28.340 --> 00:25:35.360
After the Attack on Eggman's Base
